WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
The light chain hits the crouching Marisa.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.150
OD Kikoken connects beside the wall.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.800
Standing light kick links after the projectile.

4
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.700
OD Hyakuretsukyaku connects at close range.

5
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.400
The two-kick follow-up continues the OD Legs sequence.

6
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:05.600
Marisa recovers beside the wall after the OD follow-up.
